  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BUILDING CAPACITY FOR AN EFFECTIVE SEA TURTLE CONSERVATION PROGRAM IN THE KINGDOM OF MOROCCO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to protect important loggerhead foraging populations in Moroccan waters and remnant sea turtle nesting populations in Morocco. The recipient will; 1. conduct an extensive questionairre survey of fisherman from the central and southern Moroccan coastline to determine historic and present sea turtle nesting activity; 2. work with fisherman and direct observers to assess and mitigate sea turtle bycatch in trawl, seine and longline fisheries; 3. carry out outreach and education capaigns in schools and universities; and 4 organize the 7th Mediterranean Conference on Marine Turtles in Morocco.</narrative>
  </description>
